# TOEFL Vocabulary Day57

| 단어 | 의미 | 예문 |
|---|---|---|
| predator | 포식자 | Wolves are important predators. |
| prey | 먹이, 피식자 | The predator searched for prey. |
| nutrient | 영양분 | Plants absorb nutrients from the soil. |
| organism | 생물, 유기체 | Every organism needs energy to survive. |
| consume | 소비하다, 먹다 | Herbivores consume plants. |
| transfer | 이동시키다, 전달하다 | Energy is transferred between organisms. |
| depend | 의존하다 | Many species depend on specific habitats. |
| ecosystem | 생태계 | Each species plays a role in the ecosystem. |

### 암기 포인트

- predator → 포식자
- prey → 먹이 / 피식자
- nutrient → 영양분
- organism → 생물
- consume → 소비하다 / 먹다
- transfer energy → 에너지를 전달하다
- depend on → ~에 의존하다
- ecosystem → 생태계
